	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"check dates to avoid penalty charges" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the vendor accounting department. 
After sending to the vendor accounting department, creating a receiving report should be done. 
When creating a receiving report is completed, one or more of the following paths should be executed: reporting errors to relevant team member, gathering the vendors invoice. 
When reporting errors to relevant team member is completed, the next tasks should be confirming all documents have been amended, doubling check a three-way match and gathering the receiving report, they should be done in parallel. 
After that, checking dates to avoid penalty charges should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The below text is about the process of the account payable and begins with e-mail to the vendor's accounting department.
After sending the vendor - accounting department, a receiving report should be created.
When a receipt is completed, one or more of the following steps should be performed: reporting errors to the relevant team member, obtaining vendor invoices.
When the reporting to the relevant team member is completed, the next tasks should be confirming that all documents have been amended, double checking a three-way match and gathering the receiving report.
Immediately after that, be prepared to check dates to avoid penalties.
The process is now complete.
"
